DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"RiffleLowerV2.Witness.Selection","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Witness.shorten_selection","type":"∀ (j f : ℝ → ℝ → ℝ) (s u b eta : ℝ),\n  0 < eta →\n    s ≤ u →\n      eta / 4 ≤ b →\n        ContinuousOn (fun (a : ℝ) => j a u) (Set.Icc 3 4) →\n          (∀ a ∈ Set.Icc 3 4, ContinuousOn (j a) (Set.Icc s u)) →\n            (∀ a ∈ Set.Icc 3 4, j a s = 0) →\n              (∀ a ∈ Set.Icc 3 4, 7 * eta / 8 ≤ f a u) →\n                (∀ a ∈ Set.Icc 3 4, ∀ v ∈ Set.Icc s u, -4 * (j a u - j a v) ≤ f a v - f a u) →\n                  (∀ v ∈ Set.Icc s u, f 4 u ≤ f 4 v) →\n                    ∃ theta ∈ Set.Icc 3 4,\n                      ∃ v ∈ Set.Icc s u,\n                        j theta v ≤ b / 2 - 4 * RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta ∧\n                          (theta = 3 ∨ j theta v = b / 2 - 4 * RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta) ∧\n                            7 * eta / 8 - 16 * RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta ≤ f theta v","type_dependencies":["Real","LT.lt","Real.instLT","OfNat.ofNat","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","LE.le","Real.instLE","HDiv.hDiv","instHDiv","DivInvMonoid.toDiv","Real.instDivInvMonoid","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","Real.instNatCast","Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","Nat","instOfNatNat","Nat.instNeZeroSucc","ContinuousOn","UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","Real.pseudoMetricSpace","Set.Icc","Real.instPreorder","Membership.mem","Set","Set.instMembership","Eq","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","Neg.neg","Real.instNeg","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","Exists","And","RiffleLowerV2.kappa","Or"],"value":"","value_dependencies":["Real","LT.lt","Real.instLT","OfNat.ofNat","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","LE.le","Real.instLE","HDiv.hDiv","instHDiv","DivInvMonoid.toDiv","Real.instDivInvMonoid","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","Real.instNatCast","Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","Nat","instOfNatNat","Nat.instNeZeroSucc","ContinuousOn","UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","PseudoMetricSpa