DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"RiffleLowerV2.Localization.Events","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Localization.coldLocalization_failure_le_envelope","type":"∀ {k N K : ℕ},\n  2 ≤ k →\n    ∀ (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (hN : 0 < N),\n      2 ≤ N →\n        ∀ {T eta rho chi xi : ℝ},\n          0 < T →\n            0 < eta →\n              ∀ (P : TimeProfile.BorelPartition k) (W : RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData)\n                (G : RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData K P W),\n                RiffleLowerV2.WitnessSpec cuts hN eta rho chi W →\n                  RiffleLowerV2.GeometrySpec cuts hN eta rho chi xi P W G →\n                    ↑K ≤ T * TimeProfile.logScale N →\n                      4 * ↑k * T * TimeProfile.logScale N + 4 ≤ ↑N ^ (RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta / 4) →\n                        4 ≤ ↑N ^ (RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta / 2) →\n                          16 ≤ ↑N ^ (5 * RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta / 2) →\n                            (RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts)\n                                fun (omega : TimeProfile.ShuffleSample cuts) =>\n                                ¬RiffleLowerV2.ColdLocalization hN P W G omega) ≤\n                              2 * (T + 1) * ↑N ^ (1 + T * Real.log ↑k) *\n                                Real.exp (-↑N ^ (RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta / 4) / 8)","type_dependencies":["Nat","LE.le","instLENat","OfNat.ofNat","instOfNatNat","TimeProfile.Cuts","LT.lt","instLTNat","Real","Real.instLT","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","TimeProfile.BorelPartition","RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData","RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData","RiffleLowerV2.WitnessSpec","RiffleLowerV2.GeometrySpec","Real.instLE","Nat.cast","Real.instNatCast","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","TimeProfile.logScale","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","Real.instAdd","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","Nat.instNeZeroSucc","HPow.hPow","instHPow","Real.instPow","HDiv.hDiv","instHDiv","DivInvMonoid.toDi