DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"RiffleLowerV2.Types.ClassEntropy","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Types.roundedClass_entropy_error","type":"∀ {k N K : ℕ} (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (hN : 0 < N) (P : TimeProfile.BorelPartition k) (I : Finset (Fin K))\n  (D : RiffleLowerV2.RoundedTypeData P) (q : Fin P.cellCount → Fin k → ℝ),\n  (∀ (i : Fin P.cellCount), ∑ l : Fin k, D.count i l = RiffleLowerV2.cellPositionCount cuts hN P I i) →\n    (∀ (i : Fin P.cellCount) (l : Fin k), 0 ≤ q i l) →\n      (∀ (i : Fin P.cellCount), ∑ l : Fin k, q i l = 1) →\n        (∀ (i : Fin P.cellCount) (l : Fin k),\n            |↑(D.count i l) - ↑(RiffleLowerV2.cellPositionCount cuts hN P I i) * q i l| ≤ 1) →\n          |Real.log ↑(RiffleLowerV2.roundedClass cuts hN P I D).card -\n                ∑ i : Fin P.cellCount,\n                  ↑(RiffleLowerV2.cellPositionCount cuts hN P I i) * TimeProfile.shannonEntropy (q i)| ≤\n            ↑P.cellCount * (2 * ↑k + 1) * (Real.log (↑I.card + 1) + 2)","type_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","LT.lt","instLTNat","OfNat.ofNat","instOfNatNat","TimeProfile.BorelPartition","Finset","Fin","RiffleLowerV2.RoundedTypeData","TimeProfile.BorelPartition.cellCount","Real","Eq","Finset.sum","Nat.instAddCommMonoid","Finset.univ","Fin.fintype","RiffleLowerV2.RoundedTypeData.count","RiffleLowerV2.cellPositionCount","LE.le","Real.instLE","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","Real.instAddCommMonoid","One.toOfNat1","Real.instOne","abs","Real.lattice","Real.instAddGroup","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","Nat.cast","Real.instNatCast","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","Real.log","Finset.card","RiffleLowerV2.WordOn","RiffleLowerV2.roundedClass","TimeProfile.shannonEntropy","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","Real.instAdd","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","Nat.instNeZeroSucc"],"value":"","value_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","LT.lt","instLTNat","OfNat.ofNat","instOfNatNat","TimeProfile.BorelP