DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"definition","module":"Contracts.v1.FactorialOccupancy","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Targets.RelativeJointFactorial","type":"Prop","type_dependencies":[],"value":"∀ (c C : ℝ),\n  0 < c →\n    0 < C →\n      ∃ (D : ℝ),\n        0 < D ∧\n          ∃ (N0 : ℕ),\n            ∀ N ≥ N0,\n              ∀ (k K d : ℕ),\n                ↑K ≤ C * TimeProfile.logScale N →\n                  ∀ (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (w : Fin d → RiffleLowerV2.Word k K) (r : Fin d → ℕ),\n                    Function.Injective w →\n                      (∀ (i : Fin d) (j : Fin K), c * ↑N ≤ ↑(cuts.count j (List.Vector.get (w i) j))) →\n                        ∑ i : Fin d, ↑(r i) ≤ ↑N ^ (1 / 5) →\n                          |RiffleLowerV2.expect (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.factorialProduct w r) -\n                                ∏ i : Fin d, (↑N * RiffleLowerV2.wordMass cuts (w i)) ^ r i| ≤\n                            D * (↑K + 1) * (∑ i : Fin d, ↑(r i)) ^ 2 / ↑N *\n                              ∏ i : Fin d, (↑N * RiffleLowerV2.wordMass cuts (w i)) ^ r i","value_dependencies":["Real","LT.lt","Real.instLT","OfNat.ofNat","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","Exists","And","Nat","GE.ge","instLENat","LE.le","Real.instLE","Nat.cast","Real.instNatCast","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","TimeProfile.logScale","TimeProfile.Cuts","Fin","RiffleLowerV2.Word","Function.Injective","TimeProfile.Cuts.count","List.Vector.get","Finset.sum","Real.instAddCommMonoid","Finset.univ","Fin.fintype","HPow.hPow","instHPow","Real.instPow","HDiv.hDiv","instHDiv","DivInvMonoid.toDiv","Real.instDivInvMonoid","One.toOfNat1","Real.instOne","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","RiffleLowerV2.Targets.RelativeJointFactorial._proof_1","abs","Real.lattice","Real.instAddGroup","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","RiffleLowerV2.expect","TimeProfile.ShuffleSample","TimeProfile.instFintypeShuffleSample","TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF","RiffleLowerV2.factorialP