DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Residual","name":"_private.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Residual.0.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualSampleEquiv._proof_3","type":"∀ {N k K b : ℕ} {cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K} (r : RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription N k K b)\n  (hr : Function.Injective r.row) (e : Fin (N - b) → Fin N) (he : Function.Injective e)\n  (hc : ∀ (i : Fin N), (∃ (q : Fin (N - b)), e q = i) ↔ ¬∃ (q : Fin b), r.row q = i)\n  (residual : TimeProfile.Cuts k (N - b) K)\n  (hres : ∀ (j : Fin K) (a : Fin k), residual.count j a = cuts.count j a - RiffleLowerV2.usedCount r j a)\n  (hbal : ∀ (j : Fin K) (a : Fin k), RiffleLowerV2.usedCount r j a + residual.count j a = cuts.count j a)\n  (ω : { ω : RiffleLowerV2.Sample cuts // RiffleLowerV2.prescriptionEvent r ω }),\n  ⟨RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.glueSample✝ r hr e he hc residual hbal\n        (RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.restrictSample✝ r hr e he hc residual hres ω),\n      ⋯⟩ =\n    ω","type_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription","Function.Injective","Fin","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription.row","HSub.hSub","instHSub","instSubNat","Iff","Exists","Eq","Not","TimeProfile.Cuts.count","RiffleLowerV2.usedCount","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","instAddNat","Subtype","RiffleLowerV2.Sample","RiffleLowerV2.prescriptionEvent","Subtype.mk","_private.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Residual.0.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.glueSample","_private.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Residual.0.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.restrictSample","_private.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Residual.0.RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualSampleEquiv._proof_2"],"value":"","value_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription","Function.Injective","Fin","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription.row","HSub.hSub","instHSub","instSubNat","Iff","Exists","Eq","Not","TimeProfile.Cuts.count","RiffleLowerV2.usedCount","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","instAddNat","Subtype","RiffleLowerV2.Sample","RiffleLowerV2.pr