DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"RiffleLowerV2.Types.WordEstimates","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Types.selectedClass_log_loss","type":"∀ {k N K : ℕ} (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (hN : 0 < N) (P : TimeProfile.BorelPartition k) (I : Finset (Fin K))\n  (D : RiffleLowerV2.RoundedTypeData P),\n  (RiffleLowerV2.selectedClass cuts hN P I D).Nonempty →\n    (∀ x ∈ RiffleLowerV2.roundedClass cuts hN P I D, 0 < RiffleLowerV2.massOn cuts x) →\n      (∀ (b : ℕ), (RiffleLowerV2.massBin cuts hN P I D b).card ≤ (RiffleLowerV2.selectedClass cuts hN P I D).card) →\n        ∀ {B : ℝ},\n          0 < B →\n            ↑(Finset.image (fun (x : RiffleLowerV2.WordOn k I) => ⌊-Real.log (RiffleLowerV2.massOn cuts x)⌋₊)\n                      (RiffleLowerV2.roundedClass cuts hN P I D)).card ≤\n                B →\n              |Real.log ↑(RiffleLowerV2.selectedClass cuts hN P I D).card -\n                    Real.log ↑(RiffleLowerV2.roundedClass cuts hN P I D).card| ≤\n                Real.log B","type_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","LT.lt","instLTNat","OfNat.ofNat","instOfNatNat","TimeProfile.BorelPartition","Finset","Fin","RiffleLowerV2.RoundedTypeData","Finset.Nonempty","RiffleLowerV2.WordOn","RiffleLowerV2.selectedClass","Membership.mem","SetLike.instMembership","Finset.instSetLike","RiffleLowerV2.roundedClass","Real","Real.instLT","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","RiffleLowerV2.massOn","LE.le","instLENat","Finset.card","RiffleLowerV2.massBin","Real.instLE","Nat.cast","Real.instNatCast","Finset.image","instDecidableEqNat","Nat.floor","Real.semiring","Real.partialOrder","FloorRing.toFloorSemiring","Real.instRing","Real.linearOrder","Real.instFloorRing","Neg.neg","Real.instNeg","Real.log","abs","Real.lattice","Real.instAddGroup","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub"],"value":"","value_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","LT.lt","instLTNat","OfNat.ofNat","instOfNatNat","TimeProfile.BorelPartition","Finset","Fin","Riff