DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"definition","module":"Contracts.v1.FactorialOccupancy","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Targets.UniformOccupancy","type":"Prop","type_dependencies":[],"value":"∀ (c C : ℝ),\n  0 < c →\n    0 < C →\n      ∃ (D : ℝ),\n        0 < D ∧\n          ∃ (N0 : ℕ),\n            ∀ N ≥ N0,\n              ∀ (k K : ℕ),\n                ↑K ≤ C * TimeProfile.logScale N →\n                  ∀ (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (W : Finset (RiffleLowerV2.Word k K)),\n                    RiffleLowerV2.selectedPiles cuts W c →\n                      (∀ w ∈ W,\n                          |RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent w) -\n                                RiffleLowerV2.poissonCollision (↑N * RiffleLowerV2.wordMass cuts w)| ≤\n                            D * ↑N ^ (-1 / 100) * RiffleLowerV2.poissonCollision (↑N * RiffleLowerV2.wordMass cuts w)) ∧\n                        (∀ w ∈ W,\n                            ∀ v ∈ W,\n                              w ≠ v →\n                                |(RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts)\n                                        fun (ω : TimeProfile.ShuffleSample cuts) =>\n                                        RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent w ω ∧ RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent v ω) -\n                                      RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts)\n                                          (RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent w) *\n                                        RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts)\n                                          (RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent v)| ≤\n                                  D * ↑N ^ (-1 / 100) *\n                                      RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts)\n                                        (RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent w) *\n                                    RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts)\n                                      (RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent v)) ∧\n                          RiffleLowerV2.variance (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionCount W) ≤\n                            RiffleLowerV2.expect (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionCount W) +\n                              D * ↑N ^ (-1 / 100) *\n                                RiffleLowerV2.expect (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionCount W) ^\n                                  2","value_dependencies":["Real","LT.lt","Real.instLT","OfNat.ofNat","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","Exists","And","Nat","GE.ge","instLENat","LE.le","Real.instLE","Nat.cast","Real.instNatCast","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","TimeProfile.logScale","TimeProfile.Cuts","Finset","RiffleLowerV2.Word","RiffleLowerV2.selectedPiles","Membership.mem","SetLike.instMembership","Finset.instSetLike","abs","Real.lattice","Real.instAddGroup","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","RiffleLowerV2.probability","TimeProfile.ShuffleSample","TimeProfile.instFintypeShuffleSample","TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF","RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent","RiffleLowerV2.poissonCollision","RiffleLowerV2.wordMass","HPow.hPow","instHPow","Real.instPow","HDiv.hDiv","instHDiv","DivInvMonoid.toDiv","Real.instDivInvMonoid","Neg.neg","Real.instNeg","One.toOfNat1","Real.instOne","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","RiffleLowerV2.Targets.UniformOccupancy._proof_1","Ne","RiffleLowerV2.variance","RiffleLowerV2.collisionCount","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","Real.instAdd","RiffleLowerV2.expect","NPow.toPow","Monoid.toNPow","Real.instMonoid","instOfNatNat"]}
