) ∧\n                              ∀ x ∈ RiffleLowerV2.coldPrefixFamily cuts hN P W G,\n                                e + 2 ≤\n                                    ↑(RiffleLowerV2.prefixCount (RiffleLowerV2.reservePrefix G x G.reserveMinus)\n                                        omega) ∧\n                                  e + 2 ≤\n                                    ↑(RiffleLowerV2.prefixCount (RiffleLowerV2.reservePrefix G x G.reservePlus) omega)","type_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","LT.lt","instLTNat","OfNat.ofNat","instOfNatNat","LE.le","instLENat","Real","Real.instLT","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","TimeProfile.BorelPartition","RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData","RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData","RiffleLowerV2.WitnessSpec","RiffleLowerV2.GeometrySpec","Real.instLE","Nat.cast","Real.instNatCast","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","TimeProfile.logScale","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","Real.instAdd","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","Nat.instNeZeroSucc","HPow.hPow","instHPow","Real.instPow","HDiv.hDiv","instHDiv","DivInvMonoid.toDiv","Real.instDivInvMonoid","RiffleLowerV2.kappa","RiffleLowerV2.Sample","RiffleLowerV2.allPrefixEvent","RiffleLowerV2.beta","RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData.s","RiffleLowerV2.Localization.endpointError","And","RiffleLowerV2.WordOn","RiffleLowerV2.prefixColumns","Membership.mem","Finset","SetLike.instMembership","Finset.instSetLike","RiffleLowerV2.coldPrefixFamily","abs","Real.lattice","Real.instAddGroup","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","RiffleLowerV2.relativeLowerCount","RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData.ambient","RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData.ms","RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData.mu","RiffleLowerV2.prefixMean","RiffleLowerV2.prefixAt","RiffleLowerV2.relativeMassBefore","RiffleLowerV2.relativeUpperCount","RiffleLowerV2.massOn","RiffleLowerV2.prefixCount","RiffleLowerV2.reservePrefix","RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData.reserveMinus","RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData.reservePlus"],"value":"","value_dependencies":["Nat","TimeP