DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"RiffleLowerV2.Occupancy.Covariance","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Occupancy.variance_collisionCount_le","type":"∀ {k N K : ℕ} (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (W : Finset (RiffleLowerV2.Word k K)) (η : ℝ),\n  0 ≤ η →\n    (∀ w ∈ W,\n        ∀ v ∈ W,\n          w ≠ v →\n            |(RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) fun (ω : TimeProfile.ShuffleSample cuts) =>\n                    RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent w ω ∧ RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent v ω) -\n                  RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent w) *\n                    RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent v)| ≤\n              η * RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent w) *\n                RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent v)) →\n      RiffleLowerV2.variance (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionCount W) ≤\n        RiffleLowerV2.expect (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionCount W) +\n          η * RiffleLowerV2.expect (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.collisionCount W) ^ 2","type_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","Finset","RiffleLowerV2.Word","Real","LE.le","Real.instLE","OfNat.ofNat","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","Membership.mem","SetLike.instMembership","Finset.instSetLike","Ne","abs","Real.lattice","Real.instAddGroup","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","RiffleLowerV2.probability","TimeProfile.ShuffleSample","TimeProfile.instFintypeShuffleSample","TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF","And","RiffleLowerV2.collisionEvent","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","RiffleLowerV2.variance","RiffleLowerV2.collisionCount","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","Real.instAdd","RiffleLowerV2.expect","HPow.hPow","instHPow","NPow.toPow","Monoid.toNPow","Real.inst