DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.Main","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualPrefixTransform","type":"∀ {N k K b : ℕ} (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (r : RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription N k K b),\n  b < N →\n    Function.Injective r.row →\n      0 < RiffleLowerV2.probability (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts) (RiffleLowerV2.prescriptionEvent r) →\n        ∀ (w : RiffleLowerV2.Prefix k K) (s : ℝ),\n          0 < s →\n            RiffleLowerV2.conditionalExpect (TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF cuts)\n                  (fun (ω : TimeProfile.ShuffleSample cuts) => s ^ RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualPrefixCount r w ω)\n                  (RiffleLowerV2.prescriptionEvent r) ≤\n                (1 - RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualPrefixMass cuts r w +\n                    RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualPrefixMass cuts r w * s) ^\n                  (N - b) ∧\n              (1 - RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualPrefixMass cuts r w +\n                    RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualPrefixMass cuts r w * s) ^\n                  (N - b) ≤\n                Real.exp (RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualPrefixMean cuts r w * (s - 1))","type_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription","LT.lt","instLTNat","Function.Injective","Fin","RiffleLowerV2.RowPrescription.row","Real","Real.instLT","OfNat.ofNat","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","RiffleLowerV2.probability","TimeProfile.ShuffleSample","TimeProfile.instFintypeShuffleSample","TimeProfile.fixedCountPMF","RiffleLowerV2.prescriptionEvent","RiffleLowerV2.Prefix","And","LE.le","Real.instLE","RiffleLowerV2.conditionalExpect","HPow.hPow","instHPow","NPow.toPow","Monoid.toNPow","Real.instMonoid","RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualPrefixCount","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","Real.instAdd","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","One.toOfNat1","Real.instOne","RiffleLowerV2.Thinning.residualPrefixMass","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","instSubNat","R