DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","module":"RiffleLowerV2.Ascent.MGF","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Ascent.two_class_indicator_concentration","type":"∀ {Ω : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype Ω] {I : Type u_2} (P : PMF Ω) (X : Ω → ℝ) (c : ℝ) (s₀ s₁ : Finset I)\n  (A : I → Ω → Prop),\n  (∀ (ω : Ω), X ω = (c + ∑ i ∈ s₀, if A i ω then 1 else 0) + ∑ i ∈ s₁, if A i ω then 1 else 0) →\n    (∀ (u : ℝ),\n        (RiffleLowerV2.expect P fun (ω : Ω) =>\n            ∏ i ∈ s₀, Real.exp (u * ((if A i ω then 1 else 0) - RiffleLowerV2.probability P (A i)))) =\n          ∏ i ∈ s₀,\n            RiffleLowerV2.expect P fun (ω : Ω) =>\n              Real.exp (u * ((if A i ω then 1 else 0) - RiffleLowerV2.probability P (A i)))) →\n      (∀ (u : ℝ),\n          (RiffleLowerV2.expect P fun (ω : Ω) =>\n              ∏ i ∈ s₁, Real.exp (u * ((if A i ω then 1 else 0) - RiffleLowerV2.probability P (A i)))) =\n            ∏ i ∈ s₁,\n              RiffleLowerV2.expect P fun (ω : Ω) =>\n                Real.exp (u * ((if A i ω then 1 else 0) - RiffleLowerV2.probability P (A i)))) →\n        ∀ {M t : ℝ},\n          0 < M →\n            ↑s₀.card + ↑s₁.card ≤ M →\n              0 < t →\n                (RiffleLowerV2.probability P fun (ω : Ω) => t ≤ X ω - RiffleLowerV2.expect P X) ≤\n                    Real.exp (-t ^ 2 / M) ∧\n                  (RiffleLowerV2.probability P fun (ω : Ω) => X ω - RiffleLowerV2.expect P X ≤ -t) ≤\n                    Real.exp (-t ^ 2 / M)","type_dependencies":["Fintype","PMF","Real","Finset","Eq","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","Real.instAdd","Finset.sum","Real.instAddCommMonoid","ite","Classical.propDecidable","OfNat.ofNat","One.toOfNat1","Real.instOne","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","RiffleLowerV2.expect","Finset.prod","Real.instCommMonoid","Real.exp","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","RiffleLowerV2.probability","LT.lt","Real.instLT","LE.le","Real.instLE","Nat.cast","Real.instNatCast","Finset.card